tamp": "00:39:47", "text": "我們在談什麼？不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2388.641, "timestamp": "00:39:48", "text": "注意，不要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2389.82, "timestamp": "00:39:49", "text": "注意"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2396.202, "timestamp": "00:39:56", "text": "我。嗯，你知道，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2397.334, "timestamp": "00:39:57", "text": "我剛才說到哪裡了？"}]